{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTRCV_SECTION_7_1_1_Operation_mode_switching","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_CANTransceiverDriver","page":20,"text":"7.1.1 Operation mode switching\nA mode switch is requested with a call to the function CanTrcv_SetOpMode.\n[SWS_CanTrcv_00161] ⌈A mode switch request to the current mode is allowed and\nshall not lead to an error, even if DET is enabled.⌋\n[SWS_CanTrcv_00158] ⌈The CanTrcv module shall invoke the callback func-\ntion CanIf_TrcvModeIndication, for each mode switch request with call to\nCanTrcv_SetOpMode, after the requested mode has been reached referring to the\ncorresponding CAN transceiver with the abstract CanIf TransceiverId.\nSee see [4,","caption":"7.1.1 Operation mode switching","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTRCV_SECTION_7_1_1_Operation_mode_switching","releases":["R23-11"],"page":20,"hash":"f65accbc8bfa34fa","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/c3c6383e3fab/page_20.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTRCV_SECTION_7_1_1_Operation_mode_switching","releases":["R24-11"],"page":20,"hash":"58edb149c57e41db","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/79a10681d7ec/page_20.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTRCV_SECTION_7_1_1_Operation_mode_switching","releases":["R25-11"],"page":20,"hash":"701c3e9f3aab1e29","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/a1b4b179a7ab/page_20.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/a1b4b179a7ab/page_20.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"Spezifiziert oder visualisiert den Aufrufkontext von CanIf_TrcvModeIndication().","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00764"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_CanTrcv_00158] im Text von SWS_CANTransceiverDriver.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTrcv_00158"